*> description TextComponent and the decal Boolean. PB-SLOT-DISPLAY-TABLE keeps no description, so
*> the description written is the plain String of the asset's path with its first letter in upper
*> case (minecraft:coast gives "Coast"). An invalid identifier is an error.
