     CALL "PB-PUT-IDENTIFIER" USING PB-BUFFER L-ASSET L-LENGTH
     MOVE 1 TO WS-FROM
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > L-LENGTH
         IF L-ASSET(WS-K:1) = ":"
