*> top): writes the SlotDisplay of one node of the table (05b SlotDisplay, all eleven types), its
*> children first-level after it. A node outside 1 to PB-SDT-COUNT or not after its parent (so the
*> table has no cycles), a type or a list count (0 to 8) out of range, or an item_stack, tag or trim
*> the helpers reject is an error. Unused children are 0.
